@url=http://localhost:3000
@token=PEGAR_TOKEN_ACA

### Listar todos los viajes
GET {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por vehículo
GET {{url}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes?conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por vehículo y conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=1&conductor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtro inválido (debe dar 400)
GET {{url}}/viajes?vehiculo_id=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km (sin filtro)
GET {{url}}/viajes/kilometros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Total de km por vehículo
GET {{url}}/viajes/kilometros?vehiculo_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener viaje por ID
GET {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Viaje inexistente (debe dar 404)
GET {{url}}/viajes/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar viaje
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T18:30",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 450,
  "observaciones": "Sin novedades"
}

### Llegada anterior a salida (debe dar 400)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T18:00",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T08:00",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 450
}

### Vehículo inexistente (debe dar 400)
POST {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 9999,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T18:30",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 450
}


### Modificar viaje
PUT {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T19:00",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 455,
  "observaciones": "Demora en ruta"
}

### Modificar viaje inexistente (debe dar 404)
PUT {{url}}/viajes/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehiculo_id": 1,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-10T08:00",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-10T19:00",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Córdoba",
  "kilometros": 455
}

### Eliminar viaje
DELETE {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar viaje inexistente (debe dar 404)
DELETE {{url}}/viajes/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}